#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/bot_greeter.html.heex:146
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only one bot per channel should greet. Two greeters welcome every newcomer twice, which is why a bot that stands in every room is set to greeting none. Keep the public line to one sentence: it is the only part of a welcome the whole room reads and the only part that persists. Everything a newcomer needs to learn belongs in the private half."
msgstr "每个频道只应有一个机器人负责迎新。两个迎新机器人会把每位新人欢迎两次，这也是为什么在每个聊天室里都有的机器人要设成 greeting none。公开的那一行请保持一句话：它是整个聊天室唯一都会读到、也是唯一会留下的部分。新人需要了解的一切都放在私下发送的那一半。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/bot_greeter.html.heex:21
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only the first time this bot meets this nickname here"
msgstr "只有这个机器人在这里第一次遇到这个昵称时"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/bot_greeter.html.heex:136
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Placeholders"
msgstr "占位符"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/bot_greeter.html.heex:12
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置项"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/bot_greeter.html.heex:48
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Setting them"
msgstr "如何设置"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/bot_greeter.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Greeter capability welcomes people into a channel. A welcome has two halves with different audiences: one short line the whole room reads, and the private lines that orient the newcomer without anyone else seeing them."
msgstr "迎新能力用来欢迎进入频道的人。一次欢迎由面向不同读者的两部分组成：整个聊天室都会读到的一行短句，以及只用于引导新人、其他人看不到的私下消息。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/bot_greeter.html.heex:123
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The bot records who it has welcomed into each channel, and that record survives a restart. Somebody it has never met gets the public line and the private ones. Somebody it met longer ago than greeter_repeat_window seconds gets the private ones again, but the room is not told twice. Somebody who was just here gets nothing."
msgstr "机器人会记录它在每个频道欢迎过谁，这份记录在重启后依然保留。从未见过的人会收到公开的那一行和私下的几行。距离上次见面超过 greeter_repeat_window 秒的人会再次收到私下的内容，但聊天室不会被重复通知。刚刚还在这里的人什么也收不到。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/bot_greeter.html.heex:25
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/bot_greeter.html.heex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The newcomer alone"
msgstr "只有新人"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/bot_greeter.html.heex:8
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The two halves"
msgstr "两个部分"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/bot_greeter.html.heex:14
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "When"
msgstr "何时"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/bot_greeter.html.heex:121
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Who counts as new"
msgstr "谁算是新人"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/bot_greeter.html.heex:13
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Who reads it"
msgstr "谁会读到"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/bot_greeter.html.heex:115
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "greeting_delivery covers the greeting; onboarding_delivery covers the numbered lines and falls back to greeting_delivery when it is not set. public_greeting is always public — that is what it is for."
msgstr "greeting_delivery 管的是问候语；onboarding_delivery 管的是带编号的那些行，未设置时回退到 greeting_delivery。public_greeting 始终是公开的——它本来就是为此而设。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/bot_greeter.html.heex:138
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Every line accepts {nickname} for whoever joined, {channel} for the room, {botname} for the bot and {prefix} for its command prefix. Lines also accept the IRC formatting escapes: \\c04 red, \\b bold, \\o reset."
msgstr "每一行都接受 {nickname} 表示加入的人、{channel} 表示房间、{botname} 表示机器人、{prefix} 表示它的命令前缀。这些行同样接受 IRC 格式转义：\\c04 红色、\\b 粗体、\\o 重置。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/bot_greeter.html.heex:38
